          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "T002 in `task-contract.json` is over-attributed: it lists `TemplateExportCommand`, `TemplateExportPort`, `TemplateExportPortError`, and `TemplateExportReport`, but the task text only adds/modifies `TemplateExportError` and `TemplateExportInteractor` and exercises them in tests. That makes the contract map broader than the described work and it should be trimmed to the actually touched catalogue entries.",
