              "category": "task-contract attribution mismatch"
            },
            {
              "message": "S4 / T005-T006 in `impl-plan.json` restate the upstream decision in prose, e.g. 'fixed-tag path remains available for updates and other-host adoption' and 'no new state field or approval flow is introduced', instead of the required target + operation + anchor-cite form. That violates `knowledge/conventions/no-upstream-restatement.md`.",
              "severity": "P1",
